# Arrowing quickly through a folder. Announcements for items already left must
# evaporate rather than play in sequence behind the cursor.
#
# Note there is no "drain" between the moves: the user did not wait. Only the
# item they landed on should be heard. This is what the validity predicate buys
# and what cancelling on keypress could never get right without also silencing
# things that were still wanted.

node f1 ListItem "Documents" pos=1 size=3
node f2 ListItem "Downloads" pos=2 size=3
node f3 ListItem "Music" pos=3 size=3
focus f1
focus f2
focus f3

expect
  Music, list item, 3 of 3
